body:
[A10] Added to this issue's adoption work (ruling on PR #766). `ci/image/tool-inventory.json` has four stale `inputs` rows: `sw/firmware/ctrl/test/aecp_arms.py` and `aecp_mutants.py` (PR #766), `scripts/check_doc_style.py` (#753) and `scripts/measure_test_evidence_readers.py` (#754).

The fix:
- run `scripts/ci_tool_inventory.py --write` once on the dev that includes #766;
- re-record `ci/image/image.lock.json` from two byte-identical cold builds (the recipe digest moves from 712f7b38);
- make `ci_tool_inventory.py --check` part of the gate set, so later inputs can't go stale unnoticed.
